{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":0,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"不不不，您刚刚说的溶铜这些设备基本也是外采的，而且泰金这块也占大头","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":1,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"因为他们现在做整体解决方案，从溶铜到生箔到后处理整套设备都做","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"evidence","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":2,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"哦，之前因为量起来之后，他们要靠整条线去给设备厂家配套，价格才能杀下来","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"evidence","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":3,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"如果单一采购，单价其实挺高的","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"condition","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":4,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"听明白了，跟先导的逻辑类似，他们是做整套设备的企业","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":5,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"OK，这个您讲得很清楚，谢谢","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"other","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":6,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"我想请教一下，在前段锂电铜箔这块，现在各类产品是相对标准化的，比如生箔机、阴极辊这些，还是定制化程度仍然很高","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":7,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"您提问完了是吧","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":8,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"对","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":9,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"之前了解过锂电铜箔小于9微米的，小于等于8微米的都属于锂电铜箔","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"},{"text":"锂电铜箔里面又分了极薄和标准的锂电铜箔","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":10,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"标准的是常规的6到8微米，或5到8微米","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":11,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"极薄的是小于等于4.5微米","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":12,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"这两种铜箔对应的设备基本不一样，大体的结构一样","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":13,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"但使用的配件不同","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":14,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"比如传感器、电机都不能一样","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"negated","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":15,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"薄的铜箔不能用重载电机，可能会拉断","semantic_type":"forecast","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"negated","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":16,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"厚点的可以用力矩大一点、控制精度略差的","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":17,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"因为做6到8微米是常规产品，投资不想太大，加工费也低","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"evidence","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":18,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"所以会用比较普通的传感器、电机和张力控制器","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":19,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"做三微米甚至3.5微米以下的铜箔，对控制精度要求非常高，配套的传感器、控制系统、轴承都是高精度的","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":20,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"所以设备价格也不一样","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":21,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"比如您刚说的2.5个亿，可以理解成是对应6到8微米的标品，3个亿可能对应4.5微米","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":22,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"它们之间的价值量大概是什么概念","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"question","speech_role":"question","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"unknown","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
{"record_type":"obligation_result","obligation_index":23,"status":"items","reason_code":null,"items":[{"text":"高精度的设备，您可以这么理解，3个亿会大幅提高投资","semantic_type":"fact","statement_role":"claim","speech_role":"statement","perspective":"source_explicit","polarity":"affirmed","evidence_selector":"slot"}]}
